@base = http://localhost:3012

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Draft – happy path (EN, empathetic)
POST {{base}}/api/draft/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Student improving in group work; needs help starting writing.",
  "tone": "empathetic",
  "language": "en"
}

### Draft – DE + mapper label example ("supportive" → empathetic)
POST {{base}}/api/draft/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Schülerin zeigt Fortschritte in der Gruppenarbeit; braucht Hilfe beim Start ins Schreiben.",
  "tone": "supportive",
  "language": "de"
}

### Draft – invalid tone (should 400 with AJV errors)
POST {{base}}/api/draft/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "notes": "Test invalid tone",
  "tone": "friendly",
  "language": "en"
}
